OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 15 MAR
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French celebrates 40 years
OL,6,     Gof Giardino Armonico, marks the
OL,7,     G400th anniversary of John
OL,8,     GDowland's death and learns of
OL,9,     Gsome detective work surrounding
OL,10,     Gthe composer Denis Delair.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GIn poetry by Donne, Shakespeare
OL,13,     Gand Christina Rossetti, and music
OL,14,     Gdepicting Pictures at an
OL,15,     GExhibition and a Waterloo Sunset
OL,16,     G- we explore the art of looking.
